    { "type": "text", "id": "more_t", "x": 80, "y": 806, "width": 2060, "height": 133,
      "text": "tools              a loop with two guards, because a model will ask for the same thing forever\nconversation       bookmarks and a sliding window that keeps both ends and drops the middle\nevents             sixteen types, routed by correlation id, on a buffer that drops what it cannot hold\nsuspend / resume   stop for a person, come back later, skip what already succeeded\nresilience         a fallback chain that resets the retry budget on every hop\nobservability      traces and metrics out through OpenTelemetry, events in process",
      "originalText": "tools              a loop with two guards, because a model will ask for the same thing forever\nconversation       bookmarks and a sliding window that keeps both ends and drops the middle\nevents             sixteen types, routed by correlation id, on a buffer that drops what it cannot hold\nsuspend / resume   stop for a person, come back later, skip what already succeeded\nresilience         a fallback chain that resets the retry budget on every hop\nobservability      traces and metrics out through OpenTelemetry, events in process",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
