    { "type": "text", "id": "note_t", "x": 1742, "y": 188, "width": 376, "height": 152,
      "text": "The shape is not fixed\n\nThe graph is directed and known at\ndesign time, but extensible while it\nruns. Nothing prevents a cycle: a\nstep that pushes itself loops\nforever, and the engine does not\ncheck.",
